# Mindora needs no runtime environment variables.
#
# Cloudflare credentials are intentionally NOT application environment variables.
# Authenticate locally with Wrangler:
#
#   pnpm exec wrangler login
#   pnpm exec wrangler whoami
#
# In GitHub Actions, store CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN and CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID as
# repository secrets. Never commit tokens or .dev.vars.
#
# Public deployments should enable Cloudflare Access. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
